  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": 0,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 6.72,
      "text": "I thought with confidence that this would be the year that I finally switch over to a foldable phone.",
      "duration": 6.72,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1922,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.1876,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 1,
      "start_time": 6.72,
      "end_time": 11.52,
      "text": "I've been testing these things for like seven or eight years, but I've never been drawn to one the way that I've been drawn to the fold seven.",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1922,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.1876,
      "word_count": 28
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 2,
      "start_time": 11.52,
      "end_time": 18.32,
      "text": "Because this is the first product that's been like, it looks and feels and has the weight and thickness of a regular phone.",
      "duration": 6.8,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1922,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.1876,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 3,
      "start_time": 18.32,
      "end_time": 25.240000000000002,
      "text": "It's just that when you want it to, you can open it up and it's like a bigger screen experience in a tablet-like device.",
      "duration": 6.92,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1922,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.1876,
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 4,
      "start_time": 25.799999999999997,
      "end_time": 33.96,
      "text": "And I've been using this for two weeks. I thought for sure this would be the one, but I just, I don't like it nearly as much as I thought it would.",
      "duration": 8.16,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1261,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0155,
      "word_count": 32
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 5,
      "start_time": 33.96,
      "end_time": 42.36,
      "text": "So in order to explain where I'm coming from, we have to go back a little bit and think about the origins of why we even are so enamored with foldable phones in the first place.",
      "duration": 8.4,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1261,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0155,
      "word_count": 36
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 6,
      "start_time": 42.36,
      "end_time": 51.959999999999994,
      "text": "I think it just boils down to versatility, right? We want a device that can be a phone when we want it to be and then a tablet for that big screen experience when we want it to be.",
      "duration": 9.6,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1261,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0155,
      "word_count": 39
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 7,
      "start_time": 52.2,
      "end_time": 58.28,
      "text": "And Versatile Tech, it's always so cool on paper, like a two-in-one tablet, right?",
      "duration": 6.08,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1333,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0067,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 8,
      "start_time": 58.28,
      "end_time": 63.56,
      "text": "It's like the idea that you could have a tablet and a laptop in one product, but versatility also comes with the cost.",
      "duration": 5.28,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1333,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0067,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 9,
      "start_time": 63.56,
      "end_time": 71.96000000000001,
      "text": "The cost of, I'm not talking about price, I'm talking about like you have engineering compromises that you have to make in order to have a multi-function device.",
      "duration": 8.4,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1333,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0067,
      "word_count": 28
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 10,
      "start_time": 71.96000000000001,
      "end_time": 78.76,
      "text": "So in the two-in-one tablet, you have a tablet experience that's not perfect and you have a laptop experience that's not perfect,",
      "duration": 6.8,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1333,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0067,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 11,
      "start_time": 78.76,
      "end_time": 88.28,
      "text": "but you have a versatile two-in-one product. And the same thing that's been in the case with foldable phones, you have a phone experience that's typically not perfect because it's like a little bit thicker or whatever.",
      "duration": 9.52,
      "raw_segment_count": 2,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1547,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0027,
      "word_count": 37
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 12,
      "start_time": 88.28,
      "end_time": 94.12,
      "text": "And you also have a tablet experience that's also imperfect because there's things you have to do to be able to make it foldable.",
      "duration": 5.84,
      "raw_segment_count": 1,
      "avg_logprob": -0.1547,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0027,
      "word_count": 24
    },
    {
      "segment_id": 13,
      "start_time": 94.12,
      "end_time": 106.76,
      "text": "Now, on the Fold 7 this year, I think Samsung made the phone experience really good, like as close as possible to a regular like slab phone.",
